WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:07.154
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:07.922 --> 00:00:10.791
I still don't even know what
this chamber is for.

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:14.495
I don't think I can climb those
beams; there's no grip.

00:00:14.495 --> 00:00:16.430
Oh, I know what this is like.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.499
It's like a giant esophagus.

00:00:18.499 --> 00:00:20.601
So, I guess this would be the stomach.

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:21.836
Because this could be acid.

00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:23.771
I don't know what it is.

00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:25.706
So, if that's the stomach,
then where's the...

00:00:25.706 --> 00:00:29.877
Hey, what's this?  A ladder!

00:00:29.877 --> 00:00:34.148
While, I'm 100% in favor of having
a tomb this size devoted to me,

00:00:34.148 --> 00:00:37.418
I shouldn't be put in it
until after I'm dead.

00:00:37.418 --> 00:00:39.987
You don't bury the pharaoh alive.

00:00:39.987 --> 00:00:41.856
That's what the help is for.

00:00:41.856 --> 00:00:44.158
So, if those other guys want to
stay down there and die

00:00:44.158 --> 00:00:46.327
to honor my future burial site,

00:00:46.327 --> 00:00:50.064
I guess that's okay, but it's
still a little premature.

00:00:50.064 --> 00:00:54.268
It would be better if they were
locked in and died as I was being buried.

00:00:55.369 --> 00:00:57.638
Man, this is a long climb.

00:00:57.638 --> 00:00:59.607
How much farther is it?

00:00:59.607 --> 00:01:03.978
Man, y'know, on second thought,
I'm not sure I want to be buried here.

00:01:03.978 --> 00:01:06.714
I mean, yeah, the chamber's
big, which is good,

00:01:06.714 --> 00:01:09.717
but it's all underground;
nobody's going to see this.

00:01:09.717 --> 00:01:11.819
And there needs to be
statues carved of me.

00:01:11.819 --> 00:01:12.987
And murals.

00:01:12.987 --> 00:01:15.489
They have the right idea with
the Lincoln Memorial.

00:01:15.489 --> 00:01:18.459
None of this abstract crap like
the Washington Monument.

00:01:18.459 --> 00:01:21.195
I want everybody to know it's me!

00:01:21.195 --> 00:01:23.397
Dammit!  How am I going
to get over there?

00:01:23.397 --> 00:01:25.132
Oh, is this a ledge?

00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:30.404
No, not really, but
it'll have to do.

00:01:31.839 --> 00:01:35.209
Jesus Christ, this is not a lot of room.

00:01:35.209 --> 00:01:38.579
Why is there a ladder here if
this is the only way to access it?

00:01:38.579 --> 00:01:39.513
[exhales]

00:01:39.513 --> 00:01:42.316
God, that was almost as bad as
the other elevator shaft.

00:01:42.316 --> 00:01:44.218
The one before this one, I think.

00:01:44.218 --> 00:01:45.753
The one where the guy died.

00:01:45.753 --> 00:01:47.288
I mean, the one where the guy died

00:01:47.288 --> 00:01:49.390
that wasn't the first one where
the other guy died.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.859
I-I mean, the one where the
other GUYS died.

00:01:51.859 --> 00:01:53.127
I think that's the one.

00:01:53.127 --> 00:01:54.495
That one sucked.

00:01:55.796 --> 00:01:57.064
Aaaaa!  Yow!

00:01:57.064 --> 00:01:58.499
YiyiyiyiyiYIYIYIYIYI!

00:01:58.499 --> 00:02:00.768
[gasping]

00:02:00.768 --> 00:02:02.136
Yeah, I don't know.

00:02:02.136 --> 00:02:05.339
I've been up and down so many
elevators, I'm kind of losing track.

00:02:06.307 --> 00:02:08.242
Something is happening.

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:11.178
Y'know, I don't
remember having horrible

00:02:11.178 --> 00:02:14.181
electrical shocks going through
here the first time.

00:02:14.181 --> 00:02:17.151
I do remember being in pain, though.

00:02:17.151 --> 00:02:20.087
I mean, I'm not sure it was this
exact same location,

00:02:20.087 --> 00:02:22.456
but that's been pretty consistent.

00:02:22.456 --> 00:02:28.262
In fact, if you were to sum up this whole
day in just one word, it would be "pain".

00:02:28.262 --> 00:02:30.898
Or maybe "doom".

00:02:30.898 --> 00:02:32.833
Or maybe just "bang".

00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:34.702
I guess that your vote.

00:02:34.702 --> 00:02:36.837
I guess your votes are for "dead".

00:02:36.837 --> 00:02:40.341
Though, I don't like "dead".
I think it sends the wrong message.

00:02:40.341 --> 00:02:43.544
Oh, God!  Not this again!

00:02:45.546 --> 00:02:48.015
Okay, I'll just go slow and face the wall

00:02:48.015 --> 00:02:50.317
so if I slip, I'll have
another chance to...

00:02:51.118 --> 00:02:51.819
No...

00:02:53.587 --> 00:02:54.855
No, no, no...

00:02:54.855 --> 00:02:56.857
Okay, that's enough of that.

00:02:56.857 --> 00:02:59.360
I never need to do that again.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.129
Oh, jeez.  This is the one
that's really bad.

00:03:02.129 --> 00:03:05.299
You know, I don't think of myself
as being afraid of heights,

00:03:05.299 --> 00:03:06.867
but look at this!

00:03:06.867 --> 00:03:09.103
It's DEEP!

00:03:09.103 --> 00:03:09.737
All right,

00:03:10.204 --> 00:03:10.838
all right,

00:03:11.238 --> 00:03:11.972
all right...

00:03:12.406 --> 00:03:13.040
all right....

00:03:13.674 --> 00:03:14.308
all right.....

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:15.676
all right......

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:16.844
Raaneeh!

00:03:17.778 --> 00:03:19.780
OKAY!  I ROCK!

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.448
NOW STOP MAKING ME PROVE IT!

00:03:22.249 --> 00:03:24.218
THAT WAS NOT COOL!

00:03:24.218 --> 00:03:26.754
God dammit, this thing's
blocking me again!

00:03:26.754 --> 00:03:28.155
What's your problem?!

00:03:28.155 --> 00:03:30.257
Did you see that jump I made?!

00:03:30.257 --> 00:03:31.525
Here, just move!

00:03:34.161 --> 00:03:35.095
No....

00:03:36.063 --> 00:03:39.233
Okay, I can see there's no
reasoning with you.

00:03:39.233 --> 00:03:41.035
You're going to throw a fit, fine!

00:03:41.802 --> 00:03:45.406
You know, this is what counseling is for,
but I just don't have time for this.

00:03:45.973 --> 00:03:46.907
Here!

00:03:46.907 --> 00:03:48.275
This is ridiculous.

00:03:49.443 --> 00:03:51.912
You know, that was my last grenade.

00:03:51.912 --> 00:03:54.348
Not that I expect you to care
about my feelings.

00:03:55.616 --> 00:03:56.984
God, shut up!

00:03:56.984 --> 00:03:58.819
Just shut up!

00:03:58.819 --> 00:04:00.788
I don't-- I'm not talking to you.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:04.992
Hey, it just occurred to me.

00:04:04.992 --> 00:04:07.628
What if that's only part of--WHOA!

00:04:07.628 --> 00:04:09.096
Yeah, that's close enough.

00:04:10.664 --> 00:04:13.667
What if this is the monster's
hair strands or something?

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:16.203
And the rest of it teleported
inside the Earth?

00:04:16.737 --> 00:04:20.140
It's wearing me and this entire
facility as a hat.

00:04:20.641 --> 00:04:23.210
I'm not sure how I feel about that.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.481
I wouldn't go so far and say I
feel dirty, but it's strange.

00:04:27.648 --> 00:04:30.217
[tentacles moan]

00:04:30.217 --> 00:04:31.685
Yeah.

00:04:31.685 --> 00:04:34.922
Yeah, see that moaning doesn't
help anything either.

00:04:34.922 --> 00:04:36.490
I mean, what's your motive here?

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.392
That's the real question, isn't it?

00:04:38.392 --> 00:04:41.028
All you're giving me is this
banging and moaning.

00:04:41.028 --> 00:04:43.297
I'm just not ready for this.

00:04:43.297 --> 00:04:45.299
I never should've got involved.

00:04:45.299 --> 00:04:46.934
I just want to get out of here.

00:04:49.303 --> 00:04:51.605
Whoa, whoa, what's this?

00:04:51.605 --> 00:04:53.874
Are you kidding me?

00:04:53.874 --> 00:04:57.311
Are we using tape reel
computers?

00:04:57.311 --> 00:04:59.079
No....

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:02.116
Wait, are those slots for punch cards?

00:05:02.116 --> 00:05:03.317
[tentacles moan]

00:05:03.317 --> 00:05:03.951
Shut up!

00:05:03.951 --> 00:05:04.518
No!

00:05:04.518 --> 00:05:06.220
I'm not listening to any more of this.

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:07.454
Hey, the lights are on.

00:05:09.156 --> 00:05:10.624
Hey, it's doing something.

00:05:10.624 --> 00:05:12.159
Did somebody fix this?

00:05:12.793 --> 00:05:14.194
Wait, what did I just do?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:16.930
Oh!

00:05:17.898 --> 00:05:18.766
YEAH!

00:05:18.966 --> 00:05:19.967
THAT'S RIGHT!

00:05:20.234 --> 00:05:25.272
IF YOU CAN'T TAKE THE HEAT, GET OUT
OF THE ROCKET PROPULSION TEST CHAMBER!

00:05:25.272 --> 00:05:27.107
AH HAH HAH HAH!

00:05:27.107 --> 00:05:28.342
BURN!

00:05:28.709 --> 00:05:29.710
BURN!

00:05:30.277 --> 00:05:31.879
Burn!

00:05:33.347 --> 00:05:35.834
Physics rules!

